                    1131.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. There will be no restraint, coercion, or discrimination against any Union official because of the performance of duties in consonance with this agreement, Title VII, Civil Service Reform Act of 1978, directives, etc., pertaining to Employees' rights and labor management relations; or against any Employee for filing a complaint or acting as a witness under this agreement or applicable regulations.",
            "block_bbox": [
